{
 "_about": "Palettes per material sampled from beatch-slash-cover-logo.png (target style) and beatch-slash-cover-no-logo.png (source). Coordinates are in 1672x941 image space (not canvas). Tool: game-tools/scripts/gimp/sample_palette.py. Roles: base=dominant tone, shade=hard cut shadow, deep=darkest shadow, light/highlight=lit tones. Outline thickness measured on skeleton, +-1 px. shift = mean HSV logo minus no-logo (dh degrees, ds, dv): apply to no-logo tones to approach logo tones.",
 "style": {
  "outline_thickness_px_mean": 2.0,
  "outline_thickness_px_range": [
   1.3,
   3.0
  ],
  "outline_thickness_nologo_mean_px": 2.5,
  "outline_color_typical": "#52322c",
  "outline_color_note": "warm dark brown #4c2d2f-#58372e on warm materials (wood, kiosk, rocks, shells); dark green #305130/#3e501a on leaves; dark crimson #4c0414 on hibiscus. Never pure black. Thin (1.5-3 px) on the environment, thicker on trunk and big foreground leaves. Sky, clouds, sea, sand, foam, island canopy have no outline.",
  "shade_hardness": {
   "edge_transition_px_logo": 3.48,
   "edge_transition_px_nologo": 3.43,
   "reading": "shadows are hard-cut cel shapes; edge ramp about 3 px (image softness), draw with a 1-2 px feather, never a long gradient. Gradients only on sky, far sea and lantern glow."
  },
  "saturation_mean": {
   "logo": 0.683,
   "nologo": 0.518,
   "ratio": 1.32
  },
  "value_mean": {
   "logo": 0.856,
   "nologo": 0.861
  },
  "stroke_notes": [
   "Logo cover = more saturated and contrasted: sky ultramarine (#0180fa, S 0.85 vs no-logo 0.61), sea intense cyan (S 0.89-0.98 vs 0.65-0.80), vegetation yellow-green (H 76-80) instead of olive (H 60-65).",
   "Sand is paler and creamier (#fdca8f, low contrast, few pits) vs the orange no-logo sand (#f9aa69); wet sand is pink-beige.",
   "Rocks: big smooth lit salmon planes with sharp cool violet shadow facets, thin dark outline (about 2 px), orange speckle.",
   "Fills are flat campiture + hard shadow + one light tone + a highlight; details are short strokes (specks 2-3 px, streaks 9-40 px).",
   "Sea: thin white horizontal reflections and foam bands with cool-pink underside; sky and far sea are outline-free.",
   "Wood/straw are very saturated orange (S 0.67-0.68), cream highlight #fdd49c on edges, dark brown separators 1-2 px."
  ]
 },
